            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3>Ahinsa Jeans<\/h3><h4>Give your beloved jeans a new soul<\/h4><p><\/p><p>Jeans are a personal matter. They've been with you on your first date and on your most beautiful trips. Give that back to them! <strong>Send us your favorite jeans and we'll sew you a perfectly comfortable pair of shoes.<br\/><\/strong><\/p><p>• We'll turn old jeans into new shoes.<\/p><p>• We'll give your jeans a new life.<\/p><p>• We sew according to proven Ahinsa shoes models.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/pages\/ahinsa-jeans\" title=\"Ahinsa Jeans\"><strong>How it works<\/strong><\/a><\/p>",
